   "titulo": "I want and I want",
   "texto": [
    "**Θέλω** means «I want to». To make an educated order you can say **Θα ήθελα…** (I wish), a useful fixed expression. **Έναν** accompanies a masculine, **μία** to one feminine and **ένα** to one neutral: **έναν καφέ, μία πορτοκαλάδα, ένα νερό**.",
    "**Παρακαλώ** at the end of the order equals «Please.»."
